<http://data.silknow.org/object/291e5352-aba6-3ab0-89b6-d9b1d6fe1fa8>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Description: Cover of woven silk and metal thread, pieced, backed with cotton twill and faced with woven wool.\nDark blue satin ground with a densely-packed pattern of stems, small leaves and flowers all woven with metal thread [silver strip open s-wound on a yellow silk core]; the centre of the larger flowers is red silk. The finer stems form undulating parallel lines across which scrolling leaves form a lozenge enclosing a section of the stem and four larger flower heads.\nThe difference in colouring is very noticeable where the silver metal thread has worn away to reveal its yellow silk core.\nBacking: red cotton twill.\nFacing: bias cut; striped woollen twill. Red, blue, yellow, white and dark blue stripes with either a small floral motif or a horizontal red blossom with a pair of long serrated leaves."@en , "Bordered textile panel"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/36d88ac5-535f-33e4-ac8d-7ea5179da6a7> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Description: Cover of woven silk and metal thread, pieced, backed with cotton twill and faced with woven wool.\nDark blue satin ground with a densely-packed pattern of stems, small leaves and flowers all woven with metal thread [silver strip open s-wound on a yellow silk core]; the centre of the larger flowers is red silk. The finer stems form undulating parallel lines across which scrolling leaves form a lozenge enclosing a section of the stem and four larger flower heads.\nThe difference in colouring is very noticeable where the silver metal thread has worn away to reveal its yellow silk core.\nBacking: red cotton twill.\nFacing: bias cut; striped woollen twill. Red, blue, yellow, white and dark blue stripes with either a small floral motif or a horizontal red blossom with a pair of long serrated leaves."@en , "Bordered textile panel"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/291e5352-aba6-3ab0-89b6-d9b1d6fe1fa8/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/291e5352-aba6-3ab0-89b6-d9b1d6fe1fa8/dimension/2> ;
